Z","value":7,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5213740","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1847286114035571","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"Over 10,000 wishlists. Thank you! 🎃","summary":"Yesterday evening something happened I didn't expect to see when scribbling the outlines of a haunted house on my ipad all those months ago: Scream Operator passed 10,000 wishlists.Thursday was also the busiest day the booth has ever seen. More of you started the demo than on any day before, and almost 500 of you added the game to your wishlist in a single day. I've been refreshing the numbers like a nervous ride operator watching the queue 😂. So, thank you! To everyone who played the demo, left","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:07:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035571","verified_at":"2026-10-23T13:01:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1847286114028699","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"🎃 SCREAM OPERATOR HALLOWEEN COMMUNITY EVENT 🎃","summary":"SCREAM OPERATOR HALLOWEEN COMMUNITY EVENT 🎃With Steam Next Fest well underway and Halloween night coming soon, it's time for our very first community event! Two challenges, two different prizes. Let's see what you've got! 👻🏆 MAIN EVENT: Halloween Night High ScoreRun your haunt through Halloween night. Once you've survived it, a note with your best scores appears in the top right of the main menu. Post a screenshot of that note! It keeps your best result in each category, so every new run is a ch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:27:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028699","verified_at":"2026-10-21T17:54:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1846651706691888","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"The Scream Operator DEMO is in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Steam Next Fest has started, and Scream Operator: Haunted House Manager is part of it! The free demo is live right now, so this is the week to take your first shift in the booth! ☕ In Scream Operator, you don't walk through this haunted house. You run it, from a cramped little control booth. You load nervous guests into the carts, trigger the pre-show, dispatch the ride, keep the fuses from blowing and send the empty carts back to the depot, all while the queue outside keeps growing. Or in the w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:42:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1846651706681685","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #7","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome to Dev Update #7 for Scream Operator!This Monday, October 19, Steam Next Fest begins, and Scream Operator is part of it! For a whole week, hundreds of upcoming games show off their demos, and our little haunted house is right there among them. I honestly can't wait.What's in the Demo?The demo is free and already live, so there's no need to wait until Monday. You'll start your very first shift as the new operator, get a warm (and slightly suspicious) welcome from Arthu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:24:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681685","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1846651706673748","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.8 update","summary":"Just last week, I decided I wanted to bring some new features I've been working on for V1 to the demo for everyone to play and make the demo as complete as possible before Next Fest starts this monday. Was a crazy week with short nights, and lots and lots of testing, but we made it! 👻 Demo 1.8 is live, just in time for Steam Next Fest. What's new in V1.8? I'm glad you asked.New Features | Highlights (😏)Where you put a prop matters: the closer to the track, the bigger the scare. A second copy cou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T09:47:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673748","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1846018067932816","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #6","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome to Dev Update #6 for Scream Operator! First of all: thank you so much for all your reactions to the demo! Seeing so many of you step into the control booth for the first time has been amazing, and I've been reading along with all your comments and messages. I'm genuinely so happy with how you've received it, and it gives me a huge boost of energy for everything still to come. And to everyone who wishlisted the game in the past days: a very warm welcome! Grab a stale c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T10:17:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932816","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1845383656397676","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"YOUR FIRST SHIFT STARTS TODAY! 👻","summary":"Dear everyone, You are now invited to take your place in the control booth and start your first shift as a haunted house operator. The Scream Operator Halloween Demo is now live and free for everyone to play on Steam! 🎃 Click here to visit the Steam page and start your new career: Feel free to hit me up with any comments, questions and thoughts on discord. I'll be there all day (and probably all night, who are we kidding haha) to vibe and chill! Thank you all for the support and kindness so far.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T21:59:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1844751498233720","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #5","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome Dev Update #5 for Scream Operator! From now on I'll continue checking in here every week or two with a short look at what's on my desk. Nothing fancy, just real progress from the control room. Ghost Carts, Begone Our Test Operators spotted some ghost carts at the loading station: carts stacking on top of each other, or waiting at the platform without actually being there. In a haunted house that almost feels on theme, but they were bugs, and they're gone now. A big th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T09:49:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233720","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1840944183787141","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"Come say hi in our Discord Server!","summary":"Calling all Operator Trainees to register in our Discord Server. With development progressing smoothly and the Halloween Demo coming up soon, it's time to introduce you to Arthur, the friendly old caretaker of the haunted mansion where you'll soon be starting your first shift as operator of an old, decaying dark ride. Arthur will be here to teach you the basics of the operator trade, and will fill you in here and there on the mysterious past of the mansion. To prepare for your first shift, you'r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T20:07:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787141","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1838407329269061","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtesters Needed: Be the First to Play Scream Operator!","summary":"Hi guys!First of all, thank you so much to every one of you who wishlisted Scream Operator in the past few months since I announced the game. It means the world to me that something I've been creating in my little nerd-cave has been seen and appreciated by so many of you. News about the demo!Development is moving smoothly, and I'm approaching the completion of the demo that will be freely available to all of you during the Halloween period and the October Steam Next Fest coming up. This means yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T14:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329269061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1836506165583561","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"IGN reveals Scream Operator Announcement Trailer","summary":"Beyond excited to announce that the official Scream Operator Announcement Trailer has just been revealed exclusively on IGN!In addition, the official announcement is also featured in an article on their website, which you can read here: https://www.ign.com/articles/scream-operator-haunted-house-manager-announced-for-pc For those who have been following my journey in developing this haunted house management simulator, this is the moment I have been building up to. In this trailer, you get a first","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T14:32:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165583561","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1835871199313766","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"Scream Operator featured on Rock Paper Shotgun!","summary":"Hi everyone,I am absolutely thrilled to share some massive news regarding the development of Scream Operator. Today, Rock Paper Shotgun published a dedicated feature on the game!As a solo developer, having a major outlet like RPS organically pick up the game and dive deeply into its mechanics is an incredible milestone. Editor Edwin Evans-Thirlwell took a close look at the queueing systems, the interface, and the core management loop.Here are a few highlights from the article that completely ble","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T18:57:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199313766","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1834602721203027","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"Get in line! | Managing the crowd through queues and Pre-Shows.","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome back to Devlog #4 for Scream Operator! Development is moving at an incredible pace right now. Because of this momentum, I have a massive announcement to share: Scream Operator: Haunted House Manager is officially participating in the Steam Next Fest this October! To make things even better, a playable demo will drop at the very beginning of October, perfectly timed for the start of the Halloween season. 🎃Today, we are moving away from the tracks inside the ride and fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T21:24:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721203027","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1833968530888759","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"Placing animatronics, props and other scares in your ride!","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome back to Devlog #3 for Scream Operator! First of all, a massive thank you for the ongoing support and wishlists. Seeing the community grow provides an incredible boost of motivation! Over the past few weeks, development has been moving at a great pace, and the absolute core loop of the game is finally locked in. Today, I want to take you behind the dashboard and show you exactly how you will design, customize, and optimize the layout of your haunted mansion between shi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T16:32:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530888759","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1830163047260994","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"Scares, Upgrades, and Expanding the Mansion.","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome back to another update for Scream Operator!First of all, a massive thank you to everyone who has joined the community and wishlisted the game since the store page went live. The early support gives me a huge boost of motivation as a solo developer!Development has been moving at a great pace over the last few weeks, and Scream Operator is slowly but surely coming to life. Here is what I have been working on:What’s New & Actively in Development:Ride Rooms & Scares: The ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T17:33:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047260994","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4480080-1826992588603337","game_id":"steam-4480080","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to the Operator's Seat! 👻","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome to the official Steam page for Scream Operator! If you are reading this, you are one of the very first people to discover the game. Thank you so much for the early wishlists and support, it means the world to a solo indie developer!In case you just found us: Scream Operator is a Haunted House Management Sim with a technical twist. Instead of a traditional god-mode view, you build and run your horror attraction directly from a dark, industrial dashboard. You'll need to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-17T09:53:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588603337","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4480080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4480080":"2026-10-26T12:31:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4480080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:17Z"},"5213740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:3